// Which concepts may be introduced. A concept is new when it has had no attempt, and
// it is unlocked when every concept it requires has had an attempt (practised, not
// necessarily right). A required concept the pack does not define counts as never
// practised, so a concept that names one is never offered. Concepts introduced in
// the same session do not unlock each other: that takes a logged attempt.

plan_met(Plan_learner plan_learner, int plan_required_number) {
  int plan_done = 0;
  if (plan_required_number >= 0 && plan_learner.skill.counts[plan_required_number] > 0) {
    plan_done = 1;
  }
} return int plan_done;
